{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAxLS0yMDEwL0ppc20lMjAlMjgyMDAzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Jism","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/afSVOdens3jMc1QzLA3Ps3XGSbR.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9NcQ98dSkIJF13RibV9hY8MapJa.jpg","description":"Kabir Lal is an alcoholic lawyer whose life is looking as if going down the drain. One morning he sees a stunningly attractive woman on a beach and is instantly enamored by her. By chance he sees her again in a restaurant and offers to buy her a drink. In the process he learns that her name is Sonia and she is married. Unable to resist, he asks her whether she would show him her home. It marks the beginning of a passionate affair, during which Kabir is told that Sonia's husband neglects her. But Sonia cannot leave him because she cannot support herself without her husband's money. Sonia suggests murder and Kabir, blind with lust, agrees. They manage to kill Sonia's husband and make it look like an accident, but then Kabir gets to see Sonia's other side: she no longer is the passionate lover as before, but is a cool-headed mean woman now who won't let go of her wealth at any cost.\n\nRated A · Released 17 Jan 2003 · India · Language: Hindi · 136 min\nStudio: Fish Eye Network\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2003","genres":["Thriller","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.2","runtime":"136 min","cast":["Bipasha Basu","John Abraham","Gulshan Grover","Vinay Pathak","Ranvir Shorey","Anahita Oberoi","Harsh Vasisht"],"director":["Amit Saxena"],"released":"2003-01-17T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Amit Saxena","character":"Director"},{"name":"Bipasha Basu","character":"Sonia Khanna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/j4p0NOHUNvOCBcfaZiCoyxdJJou.jpg"},{"name":"John Abraham","character":"Kabir Lal","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xqOzxrbBkgbzT0pgAR2k03Hvd30.jpg"},{"name":"Gulshan Grover","character":"Rohit K